cff-version: 1.2.0
title: OpenChem Studio
message: >-
  If you use this software in work that you publish, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - alias: xaerogonzo
    website: "https://github.com/xaerogonzo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/xaerogonzo/OpenChem-Studio"
url: "https://github.com/xaerogonzo/OpenChem-Studio"
abstract: >-
  A desktop chemistry workbench combining 2D structure editing, 3D and
  macromolecular visualisation, ~46 calculators, molecular docking via
  AutoDock Vina, quantum chemistry and NMR prediction via ORCA, and an
  offline deterministic IUPAC naming engine. Predictions are benchmarked
  against literature or reference implementations and labelled by the
  level of confidence they have been shown to earn.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - computational-chemistry
  - molecular-docking
  - nmr-prediction
  - iupac-nomenclature
  - rdkit
  - autodock-vina
  - orca
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
version: 0.9.0
date-released: "2026-08-04"
